---
const { items = [] } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 relative">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-purple-50/30 to-white"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <div class="relative flex justify-center order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 to-secondary/10 rounded-3xl rotate-2"></div>
        <img
          src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/2-1.png"
          alt="Reliable offsite backup"
          class="relative rounded-3xl shadow-2xl w-full max-w-lg"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 order-1 lg:order-2">
        <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary text-sm font-semibold">
          Data Protection
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight">
          Reliable Offsite Backup..
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Data backup is important for small business owners to invest in because it ensures that their important data is protected and can be easily restored in the event of a disaster or other data loss event.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Having a good backup strategy in place can help minimize the impact of data loss on a business and get it back up and running quickly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
